      "problem": "Consider the equivalence relation $∼$ on $Z,$ defined by $x∼y$ if $3\\,|\\,(x-y).$ Which of the following equivalence classes contain the element $5?$\n\nI. $[3]$\n\nII. $[-1]$\n\nIII. $[8]$",
